# Source archive of original images from the .net site's developer.
# 84 MB, and everything the site needs has been extracted into public/ by
# scripts/restore-from-zip.mjs. Committing it would bloat both the repo and the
# Vercel deployment with files no page ever requests.
Images.zip

# Reference screenshots used to compare the clone against the live site by hand.
# 11 MB of PNGs that no page requests — same reason as Images.zip above. Kept on
# disk for reference, out of the repo and the deployment.
Manual comparisons between our cloned website and the original/
.qa-cache/
